---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ReviewSlider from "../components/ReviewSlider.astro";
import ContactForm from "../components/ContactForm.astro";
---

<Layout title="Velocity Marketing — Paid Media Specialist" description="I help businesses achieve measurable growth with strategic, data-driven paid media.">
  <section id="hero" class="section hero home-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-heading-line"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Independent paid media specialist</span><span class="hero-location">Based in Traralgon, VIC</span></div>
      <div class="grid two-col align-center">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1 class="display">Paid media.<br />Real <span class="accent-word">momentum.</span></h1>
          <p class="lead">Turn the right clicks into your next customers. I’m Mike — your hands-on partner for Google, Meta and LinkedIn advertising.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a href="#contact" class="btn primary">Get a free consultation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a href="#services" class="text-link">Explore services <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-proof"><span class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span><span>Good people. Great partnerships.</span></div>
        </div>
        <figure class="hero-art portrait-panel">
          <div class="portrait-topline"><span>A personal approach.<br />A performance mindset.</span><span class="portrait-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
          <span class="portrait-word" aria-hidden="true">velocity</span>
          <img src="/img_8071.png" alt="Mike Nicholas, your paid media specialist" width="1295" height="1367" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" class="hero-photo" />
          <figcaption class="portrait-caption"><span><strong>Mike Nicholas</strong><span>Paid media specialist</span></span><a href="#about" aria-label="More about Mike Nicholas">↗</a></figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="stats hero-stats" aria-label="Experience and approach">
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat__num">10<span class="accent-word"> years</span></span><span class="stat__label">Paid media experience</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat__num">One specialist.</span><span class="stat__label">Google, Meta & LinkedIn</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="stat__num">Your growth.</span><span class="stat__label">Always the focus</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="services" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow section-kicker">01 / What I do</span>
      <div class="section-heading reveal"><h2 class="h2">The right channels.<br />The right customers.</h2><p class="lead">Thoughtful strategy. Hands-on management. Paid media built around what your business needs next.</p></div>
      <div class="services-list">
        <a href="/google-ads-traralgon" class="service-row reveal"><span class="service-number">01</span><div><h3>Google Ads</h3><span class="service-tags">Search · Shopping · Display</span></div><p>Be there when it matters. Connect with people actively searching for what you offer, right when they’re ready to act.</p><span class="service-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <article class="service-row reveal"><span class="service-number">02</span><div><h3>Meta Ads</h3><span class="service-tags">Facebook · Instagram</span></div><p>Turn a moment of attention into a lasting connection. Reach the right people with campaigns that get your business noticed.</p></article>
        <article class="service-row reveal"><span class="service-number">03</span><div><h3>LinkedIn Ads</h3><span class="service-tags">B2B · Lead generation</span></div><p>Start conversations with the people who make decisions. Reach your ideal business audience and build a stronger pipeline.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <ReviewSlider />
  <section id="about" class="section">
    <div class="container about-layout">
      <div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow section-kicker">03 / Meet Mike</span><h2 class="h2">A specialist.<br /><span class="accent-word">In your corner.</span></h2><p class="about-signature">Mike Nicholas<span>Velocity Marketing</span></p></div>
      <div class="reveal"><p class="lead">Great campaigns start with understanding your business. I’m Mike, a paid media specialist with 10 years of experience helping businesses turn advertising into measurable growth.</p><p>I bring a hands-on, data-driven approach to every campaign, with clear communication along the way. You’ll know what we’re doing, why we’re doing it, and how it’s performing.</p><ul class="checklist"><li>10 years of experience across a diverse range of clients</li><li>Certified across Google, Meta and LinkedIn ad platforms</li><li>Clear reporting, honest conversations and a focus on results</li></ul></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="contact" class="section contact-section">
    <div class="container contact-layout">
      <div><span class="eyebrow section-kicker">04 / Let’s talk</span><h2 class="h2">Your next chapter<br />starts with a<br />conversation.</h2><p class="lead">Tell me a little about your business and where you’d like to take it. Let’s find out what the right paid media strategy could do for you.</p><div class="contact-details"><a href="mailto:mike@velocitymarketing.com.au">mike@velocitymarketing.com.au ↗</a><a href="tel:0427733566">0427 733 566 ↗</a></div></div>
      <ContactForm />
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
